// ext4_a: 1 KiB blocks, extents, journal, 64bit, flex_bg.   ext4_b: 4 KiB blocks, extents, no journal.
// ext4_c: 1 KiB blocks, no extents (block maps incl. double indirect), no 64bit/flex_bg.
// ext4_d: image A after `e2fsck -fD` (htree-indexed directories).

